<title>TURKEY: Turkey sugar output up 43 pct to 1.842 mln in '96.</title>
<headline>Turkey sugar output up 43 pct to 1.842 mln in '96.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's sugar output rose 43 percent to 1.842 million tonnes in calendar 1996 from 1.29 million tonnes a year earlier, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>It said 1.539 million tonnes of the 1996 output was produced by Turkseker, the state company which operates 25 of the 28 refineries in Turkey, against 947,700 tonnes it produced in 1995.</p>
<p>It did not give other details.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
